<title>UK: DSL Bank sets $300 million four-year bond.</title>
<headline>DSL Bank sets $300 million four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nomura International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL BANK DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT	  $300 MLN  COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    13.FEB.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.16    PAY DATE    13.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.76     SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMS US/UK/DE/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 15.NOV.99 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
